{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentIndex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Storages address their per-type state and the per-entity component bitset by this value."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default implementation assigns indices lazily: the first access of a type takes the next free index"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the process, later accesses look it up in a thread-safe table. The index is process-wide, not per "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so all nexuses of a process agree on it. Indices are dense ("},{"code":"0 ..< n","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"code":"n","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" types used so far) and unbounded."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They depend on the order of first use and are not stable between process launches;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/stableIdentifier"},{"type":"text","text":" for persistent data."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift has no stored static properties in generic types, so a plain conformance can not cache its index in a static."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provide your own implementation (the "},{"code":"@Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" macro will) as a stored "},{"code":"static let","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for a plain load,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but only if you can guarantee that two types never share an index and that it is in "},{"code":"0 ..< 1_048_576","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Indices are process-wide: a hand-assigned index must not collide with a lazily assigned one of another type."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A collision or an index out of range traps at first use of the type in a nexus."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(1)","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Complexity"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The dense index of this component type."}],"metadata":{"title":"componentIndex","roleHeading":"Type Property","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentIndex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentPAAE14componentIndexSivpZ","extendedModule":"FirebladeECS"},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component\/componentIndex-5oxlf"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/component\/componentindex-5oxlf"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swif